# Copy to .dev.vars for `mise run dev` (never commit .dev.vars).
#
# No secrets are required: on a fresh database the site asks you to claim it with a one-time code
# that the Worker prints to its log (the `mise run dev` terminal, or Worker → Logs on Cloudflare).
#
# Optional, and deliberately commented out (the Deploy to Cloudflare button offers every secret
# listed here, and a placeholder accepted as-is would let anyone become an admin): whoever presents
# CAIRN_SETUP_TOKEN at sign-up (or in Settings → Admin) becomes an admin.
# CAIRN_SETUP_TOKEN=a-long-random-string
#
# Optional: use the deterministic fake embedder + in-DO vector store so semantic search
# works offline (Workers AI / Vectorize are not bound in the local env).
# CAIRN_FAKE_EMBEDDINGS=1
